    "Let Vigil read your ~/.claude folder so it can tell when Claude Code is working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaube Vigil, deinen Ordner ~/.claude zu lesen, damit es erkennt, wann Claude Code arbeitet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let Vigil read your ~/.claude folder so it can tell when Claude Code is working."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite a Vigil leer tu carpeta ~/.claude para que sepa cuándo trabaja Claude Code."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez Vigil à lire votre dossier ~/.claude pour qu'il sache quand Claude Code travaille."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consenti a Vigil di leggere la cartella ~/.claude così può capire quando Claude Code lavora."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Разрешите Vigil читать папку ~/.claude, чтобы он понимал, когда Claude Code работает."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Claude Code tell Vigil exactly when it starts and stops, instead of Vigil inferring it from files. This is also what makes \"an agent is waiting for you\" reliable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lässt Claude Code Vigil genau mitteilen, wann es startet und stoppt, statt dass Vigil es aus Dateien ableitet. Genau das macht „Ein Agent wartet auf dich“ zuverlässig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets Claude Code tell Vigil exactly when it starts and stops, instead of Vigil inferring it from files. This is also what makes \"an agent is waiting for you\" reliable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que Claude Code le diga a Vigil exactamente cuándo empieza y termina, en vez de que Vigil lo deduzca de los archivos. Esto es lo que hace fiable «un agente te está esperando»."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à Claude Code d'indiquer à Vigil exactement quand il démarre et s'arrête, au lieu que Vigil le déduise des fichiers. C'est aussi ce qui rend « un agent vous attend » fiable."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permette a Claude Code di dire a Vigil esattamente quando inizia e finisce, invece di farlo dedurre dai file. È anche ciò che rende affidabile «un agente ti sta aspettando»."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Позволяет Claude Code сообщать Vigil, когда именно он начинает и заканчивает, вместо того чтобы Vigil догадывался по файлам. Именно это делает надёжным «агент ждёт вас»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
